      "about": "Bachelor of Electronics and Communication engineering with 14+yrs of experience in Medical Research & Development and Quality Assurance of Sustenance and NPI projects. \nExperience in end to end test design for Class II/III Products. \nContributed to Four 510 K approved Medical Devices\nDesign / Review/ Approve design control documents incl. VOC, DDP, Design Inputs/ Outputs, DHF, Risk Management, Test strategy, V&V plans, Test Traceability, etc.\nExpertise in delivering products in compliance with IEC 62304 (FDA Recommended Standard) & \nIEC 60601, ISO 14971(Risk Management), ISO 13485 (QMS) , DFMEA\nReview software system test plan, protocols, test cases and test report against the requirements and design change coverage.\nEnsure defect logging and adequate test result reporting of testing.\nEnsure new risks are added to the Software Risk Assessment document.\nMonitor, Analyze and Report global, site level and internal KPI’s.\nParticipate and Contribute to Risk management activities DFMEA, AFEMA sessions.\nEnd to End Product Testing of PD Products\nWorking closely with cross-functional teams on design changes.\nSupport ISO 13485 certification, CAPAs and audits (External-Global and Regulatory Bodies).\nIQ, OQ and PQ Qualification of all software’s for V&V Lab.\nDesign transfer and have working knowledge of 21 CFR 820 regulations, ISO13485, ISO62304, ISO62366, ISO14971 standards etc. \nProficient in test automation using  Python , JavaScript language.  \nProficient in TDD  and BDD test frame works.\nExpertise in Data Driven  and Modular test framework.\nExpertise in HIPAA and HL7 standards\nExperience in TFS and Azure Devops (CI/CD).\nParticipated in Connectathon and tested the interoperability of health information systems\nTrack and report upon testing activities, including testing results, test case coverage, required resources, defects logged and their status to product owners and Scrum master.\nExperience in Imaging and Embedded devices.\nManaging the day-to-day activities of the Hardware and Software Test team within an Agile/Scrum environment.\nExpertise in Test Automation tools like Squish, Ranorex",
